{"id":"6ee8cfd396a576ca","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AxZSource.md","title":"AxZSource","display":"AxZSource","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"AxZSource","parameters":["a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"AxZSource"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ AxZSource a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists b\n  (and\n    (or\n      (@ SetCodeExtensionality b)\n      (or\n        (@ SetCodeEmpty b)\n        (or\n          (@ SetCodePairing b)\n          (or\n            (@ SetCodeUnion b)\n            (or\n              (@ SetCodePower b)\n              (or (@ SetCodeInfinity b) (or (@ SetSeparationRaw b) (@ SetClassFoundationRaw b))))))))\n    (@ SetUC b a)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d33ef16e80f53d46\" href=\"?note=d33ef16e80f53d46\" title=\"ZFC_SetClassFoundationRaw\">SetClassFoundationRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"383c1dded6570ac4\" href=\"?note=383c1dded6570ac4\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodeEmpty\">SetCodeEmpty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e149d4a79d41a919\" href=\"?note=e149d4a79d41a919\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodeExtensionality\">SetCodeExtensionality</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a14a266808318b0e\" href=\"?note=a14a266808318b0e\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodeInfinity\">SetCodeInfinity</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0f55b121e0c786b7\" href=\"?note=0f55b121e0c786b7\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodePairing\">SetCodePairing</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e40b503b4e36b3c5\" href=\"?note=e40b503b4e36b3c5\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodePower\">SetCodePower</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"71cf8b560be7b6f0\" href=\"?note=71cf8b560be7b6f0\" title=\"ZFC_SetCodeUnion\">SetCodeUnion</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee0894114d416943\" href=\"?note=ee0894114d416943\" title=\"ZFC_SetSeparationRaw\">SetSeparationRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1e614d50ee9b59d5\" href=\"?note=1e614d50ee9b59d5\" title=\"ZFC_SetUC\">SetUC</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ AxZSource a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SetClassFoundationRaw","status":"resolved","id":"d33ef16e80f53d46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_SetClassFoundationRaw|SetClassFoundationRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeEmpty|SetCodeEmpty]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeExtensionality|SetCodeExtensionality]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeInfinity|SetCodeInfinity]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePairing|SetCodePairing]]；[[ZFC_SetCodePower|SetCodePower]]；[[ZFC_SetCodeUnion|SetCodeUnion]]；[[ZFC_SetSeparationRaw|SetSeparationRaw]]；[[ZFC_SetUC|SetUC]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SetCodeEmpty","status":"resolved","id":"383c1dded6570ac4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","lo